First, I check my supplies.
I look into my kitchen cupboards.
I already have onions and eggs here.
A Brötchen from yesterday is also lying on the table.
That is perfect for the recipe.
Then I write a short shopping list.
I need a kilo of potatoes.
And I need half a kilo of minced meat, of course.
Afterwards, I also put mustard and mayonnaise on the list.
I look at my phone one more time.
Yes, the list is complete.
Timo and Lena are coming to visit this evening.
I have to go shopping now.
I take my backpack from the hallway.
The weather is warm, so I do not need a jacket today.
I leave the flat and walk to the supermarket.
